<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 6/7.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 6/7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 6/7. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    August 6/7    August 5/6</p>
<p>    CZK    0.432	     0.42857</p>
<p>    DKK    2.09888	   2.09886</p>
<p>    FIM    2.68759	   2.68239</p>
<p>    GBP   24.2048	   24.40283</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07568	   0.07511</p>
<p>    LTL    3.7692	    3.74023</p>
<p>    LVL   25.5536	   25.41452</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00256	   0.00258</p>
<p>    SEK    1.86478	   1.85557</p>
<p>    UAH    8.1192	    8.06185</p>
<p>    USD   15.076	    14.9628</p>
<p>    XEU   15.7768	   15.09748</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
